[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14829.83, "timestamp": "04:07:09", "text": "您先请。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14839.269, "timestamp": "04:07:19", "text": "如果您要这样做，请将双手放在购物车内。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14841.75, "timestamp": "04:07:21", "text": "不想失去他们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14844.15, "timestamp": "04:07:24", "text": "我的天哪，那一定很可怕。哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14847.03, "timestamp": "04:07:27", "text": "我的大人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14854.229, "timestamp": "04:07:34", "text": "这里没有海鸥。有多少票？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14856.87, "timestamp": "04:07:36", "text": "绿色方框里有吗？数百人。在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14859.11, "timestamp": "04:07:39", "text": "事实上，我们在前往目的地的路上看到了不少。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14861.91, "timestamp": "04:07:41", "text": "就在我们说话的时候，12号保险库。只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14863.99, "timestamp": "04:07:43", "text": "主大厅下方，就是你所在的金库。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14866.229, "timestamp": "04:07:46", "text": "现在看到的是最新的。私人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14868.15, "timestamp": "04:07:48", "text": "银行公共区域的入口"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14869.67, "timestamp": "04:07:49", "text": "带什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14872.63, "timestamp": "04:07:52", "text": "它们最为常见。只有一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14875.349, "timestamp": "04:07:55", "text": "伟大的。就像过山车一样"}]